WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:02.627
♪ ("EL DESEO"
BY JANET SHERBOURNE PLAYS) ♪

00:00:02.711 --> 00:00:04.337
-What are you doing?
-I think I'm eating an apple.

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:06.339
Okay. I'm worried you're not
taking this seriously.

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:07.590
You're blithely
eating an apple here.

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:09.509
There's no other way
to eat an apple but blithely.

00:00:09.592 --> 00:00:11.636
-Yeah, but I need--
-That's how apples are eaten.

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:14.389
How do you serve eggs
without toast?

00:00:14.472 --> 00:00:16.057
You can't serve the eggs
without the toast.

00:00:16.141 --> 00:00:18.476
You are like a president
in the 18th century

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:19.894
on the back of a train saying,

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:23.648
"And there will always be
toast with eggs."

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:26.776
I think you can introduce me
sort of as a renaissance man.

00:00:27.068 --> 00:00:29.404
A guy who speaks six languages.

00:00:29.487 --> 00:00:31.781
You wanna impress people
with lies?

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:33.241
Well,
how else do you impress them?

00:00:33.324 --> 00:00:35.452
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

